  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Drip Irrigation Sprinkler” is implemented by the Department of Horticulture, Government of Uttarakhand. The scheme aims to promote efficient and sustainable irrigation for horticultural crops by providing farmers with modern irrigation systems and financial subsidies to enhance productivity and water conservation.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n1. The applicant must be a resident of Uttarakhand.\n1. The applicant must be a farmer and hold a Udhyan Card.\n1. The farmer must either own agricultural land or have land on lease.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
